# OPTIONAL: Override the bundled Spotify Client ID with your own.
#
# Lyripop ships with a bundled Client ID, so end-users don't need this file.
# Power users (forks, sovereignty, separate Spotify quota) can override the
# bundled Client ID by:
#   1. Creating a Spotify Developer app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
#      with redirect URI: http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback (PKCE — no client_secret)
#   2. Copying this file to `.env.local` and pasting the Client ID below
#
VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
